id: pacifist-bonded
name: Pacifist Bonded
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Spiritual Pacifist (2)'s - on whoever a Spiritual Pacifist is Bonded to, put on and taken off as the
# Bond is made and moved (chat.mjs bondTo).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spiritual Pacifist: Combat Rolls 1(T) higher while a Spiritual Pacifist is Bonded to you.
text: >
  Spiritual Pacifist (2): Your Bonded Ally has their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T).

---

[passive]
combatRolls += 1(T);
